     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi<br><br>I just want to make sure that I will be running 3 independent chains with the following code (I&#39;m using Linux). Specifically, am I defining rng_seed OK?<br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">parallel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">rstan</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>setwd</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;~/ions/&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>load</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;Co_data_oct16.dat&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>foo </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> stan</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">file </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;oct16.stan&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> data </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> datalist</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> chains</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>rng_seed </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">12345</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>sflist </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> mclapply</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>          </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>          mc</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">cores </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>           </span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> stan</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">fit </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> foo</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                            data </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> datalist</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                            iter</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">5000</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                            thin</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                            seed </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> rng_seed</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                            chains </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                            chain_id </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                            refresh </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>modfit </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sflist2stanfit</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">sflist</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div><br><br><br>thanks<br><br>Mark<br></div>"
